00:02:03.510 --> 00:02:07.940
Coincidentally, we just bought brand-new swimsuits. Didn't we, Kazuki-chan?

00:02:07.940 --> 00:02:10.400
Eh? Um, yeah...

00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:12.600
All right, ocean, here we come!

00:02:14.270 --> 00:02:15.480
Okay!

00:02:15.830 --> 00:02:19.360
Kazuki-chan, haven't you taken your bath yet?

00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:22.280
S-Sorry, I'm just about to get in!

00:02:24.040 --> 00:02:29.080
Living 10

00:02:24.040 --> 00:02:29.080
Is it Bikini Time?

00:02:24.040 --> 00:02:29.080
Let's Gather!

00:02:29.410 --> 00:02:31.080
The shining sun!

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:33.540
Blue sky... white clouds...

00:02:33.540 --> 00:02:36.460
The beach that seems to go on forever...

00:02:36.460 --> 00:02:39.220
AND THE GIRLS IN SWIMSUITS!

