Wait up~

00:02:46.260 --> 00:02:48.600
I've been baited and switched! {This is not what we expected...}

00:02:48.600 --> 00:02:50.990
Nobody ever "switched" anything.

00:02:50.990 --> 00:02:52.740
It's nice and quiet.

00:02:52.740 --> 00:02:54.570
Yeah, Onii-chan.

00:02:54.570 --> 00:02:57.440
Seriously, just quit while you're not too far behind.

00:02:57.440 --> 00:02:59.030
What was that?!

00:02:59.030 --> 00:03:00.840
This place is a well-kept secret.

00:03:00.840 --> 00:03:02.660
A great find from Kogorou-san.

00:03:02.660 --> 00:03:05.070
Haha, that's just like you, Gorou-sensei.

00:03:05.070 --> 00:03:07.950
Yeah, you haven't changed at all.

00:03:07.950 --> 00:03:10.770
But this sure is a cool place, isn't it?

00:03:10.770 --> 00:03:12.670
I'm glad you like it.

00:03:12.670 --> 00:03:16.630
If I'd known what was in store for me here,
 I would've stayed home.

00:03:16.630 --> 00:03:18.190
Knock it off, Yuuji!

00:03:18.190 --> 00:03:19.450
W-What?

00:03:19.450 --> 00:03:24.000
Kogorou-sensei was nice enough to bring us here, and <i>this</i>  is how you repay him?

00:03:25.210 --> 00:03:28.180
Geez, you really are a child...

