What did you say?!

00:03:28.960 --> 00:03:30.350
Hey!!

00:03:30.760 --> 00:03:33.310
The sooner you get changed,
 the sooner we can play!

00:03:33.310 --> 00:03:35.060
Girls

00:03:35.970 --> 00:03:37.630
I hate that so much...

00:03:36.850 --> 00:03:38.440
Same here...

00:03:39.770 --> 00:03:43.780
Why is Yuuji always so rude
