00:03:43.780 --> 00:03:45.840
I keep telling you, he's jealous.

00:03:45.840 --> 00:03:47.480
No, he isn't.

00:03:47.480 --> 00:03:51.670
He totally failed the jealousy test
 that you told me about.

00:03:51.670 --> 00:03:53.120
Really?

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:56.090
Yeah. You're reading too deeply into this.

00:03:57.090 --> 00:03:58.350
Man...

00:03:58.350 --> 00:04:01.550
Hey, Kagura, look at that!

00:04:02.380 --> 00:04:06.050
It's almost commanding us to take a peek.

00:04:06.050 --> 00:04:09.490
No! This is our sworn duty! 
Don't you agree?

00:04:09.490 --> 00:04:10.980
I agree that you're-

00:04:10.980 --> 00:04:13.310
What kind of swimsuit did you buy?

00:04:14.280 --> 00:04:15.980
I went the "adventurous" route.

00:04:15.980 --> 00:04:20.280
Ouch! Marie-chan, don't pull so hard.

00:04:20.280 --> 00:04:21.940
They're too springy.

00:04:21.940 --> 00:04:24.680
Wow, they really jiggle <i>that</i>  much?

00:04:24.680 --> 00:04:29.870
Onee-chan, don't blindside me with those crushing hazards of yours!

00:04:34.030 --> 00:04:36.730
Hey guys, do you like what you hear?

00:04:36.730 --> 00:04:39.270
Seeing women naked is every guy's dream.

00:04:39.850 --> 00:04:43.600
 However, you'll be spotted immediately if you peek from above.

00:04:43.600 --> 00:04:46.800
Behold! A treasure left behind by our distinguished predecessors.

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:49.490
Is this guy really a teacher?

00:04:49.490 --> 00:04:52.280
Let's just say that Gorou-sensei is "spontaneous." {Ryoumi: "experienced" -- not even close}

00:04:52.280 --> 00:04:54.260
So, who's going first?

00:04:54.260 --> 00:04:57.020
Kagura, you sneaky little punk!

00:04:57.020 --> 00:05:01.230
Sorry. but I'm going to have a look at you, Kazuki.

00:05:02.060 --> 00:05:04.500
Ah? It's so dark, I can't see anything!

00:05:08.060 --> 00:05:10.820
OUCH~!! What IS this?!

00:05:10.230 --> 00:05:11.890
It has some habanero chilis in it.

00:05:11.890 --> 00:05:14.860
My eyes! I need those for seeing!

00:05:11.890 --> 00:05:15.920
Sometimes, I wish I weren't so good at predicting everything Yuuji does.

00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:20.000
 Hey now, this ditzy teacher was the one who told us about the hole!

00:05:21.460 --> 00:05:22.840
Onii-chan!

00:05:22.840 --> 00:05:23.920
Oh my, oh my.

00:05:25.380 --> 00:05:27.340
I don't buy it! {Ryoumi: I don't think so!}{Alternate possibility: Cool story, bro.}

00:05:27.340 --> 00:05:29.890
I'm telling you...

00:05:31.310 --> 00:05:34.770
Only the scum of the earth
 try to shift the blame!

00:05:34.770 --> 00:05:36.620
No, he's telling the truth.

00:05:36.620 --> 00:05:37.870
Sensei...

00:05:37.870 --> 00:05:40.710
This is wrong, Gorou-sensei...

00:05:42.780 --> 00:05:45.680
Shameless opportunism is just as wrong!

00:05:50.760 --> 00:05:52.370
I'm just as shocked...

00:05:52.780 --> 00:05:54.450
Kogorou-sensei!

00:05:54.450 --> 00:05:58.670
Well, you're all so cute
 that we couldn't help but look.

00:05:58.670 --> 00:06:01.480
Think of it as proof of your womanly charms.

00:06:01.480 --> 00:06:04.070
You're saying <i>we're</i>  cute? 
Aw, you flatterer.{Ryoumi: To tell us that we are cute, you shouldn't have. Zalis: *facepalm + tears*}

00:06:04.070 --> 00:06:05.290
He's got game. {Which is worse, me using slang in this line, or Ryomi missing it entirely?}

00:06:05.290 --> 00:06:09.090
If only my brother were that innocent.
 It'd be a nice change of pace.

00:06:09.090 --> 00:06:13.430
That condition is simply beyond 
Yuuji's capacity to feel.

00:06:14.280 --> 00:06:17.470
So I just have to take his "light and breezy" approach?

00:06:17.470 --> 00:06:18.560
Oh~ You girls are all so cute that I can't...

00:06:18.560 --> 00:06:20.480
Oh~ You girls are all so cute that I can't...

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:23.700
...decide whether to look at
 your boobs or your butts.

00:06:24.730 --> 00:06:27.180
In what universe is that the same?

00:06:27.710 --> 00:06:32.200
And, Kogorou-sensei... no matter what you say, peeping is still wrong!

00:06:32.200 --> 00:06:35.350
It's still wrong? What a pity.

00:06:36.430 --> 00:06:39.160
Haha, we got scolded.

00:06:43.340 --> 00:06:45.000
I swear!

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:48.420
Oh, just get over it and get changed.

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:49.320
<i>Yes~!</i>

00:06:49.320 --> 00:06:53.340
I'll stand guard in case Yuuji comes back for another peepshow.

00:06:53.340 --> 00:06:58.560
Why the wait? Surely you aren't <i>still</i> embarrassed to wear your swimsuit?

00:06:58.560 --> 00:07:02.670
That's not it - she wants the first person to see her swimsuit to be...

00:07:02.670 --> 00:07:04.190
...the one who selected it.

00:07:04.190 --> 00:07:06.780
Why do I have to show it off to Yuuji first?!

00:07:07.650 --> 00:07:11.160
Ah~ maidens in love are so noble-hearted!

00:07:11.160 --> 00:07:14.680
Huh? The one Arisaka-san
 likes is Kagura-kun?

00:07:14.680 --> 00:07:17.120
I always thought it was Kogorou-sensei...

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:20.580
Heh? No, I'm not in love with either one.

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:22.790
Or perhaps you're torn between the two?

00:07:22.790 --> 00:07:26.170
Ah, so that's the wrong idea
