00:07:26.170 --> 00:07:28.340
 You're the one who <i>gave</i>  her that idea!

00:07:30.020 --> 00:07:33.760
A-Anyway, we're gonna go on ahead.

00:07:34.530 --> 00:07:36.640
Kazuki, hurry up and finish changing!{Ryoumi: Kazuki should change quickly. // a prime example of the overliteral 3rd-person -> 2nd-person transformation failure that's endemic throughout the Ryoumi subs.}

