What kinds of swimsuits are we going to see?

00:07:45.290 --> 00:07:47.540
Ah~ I can't wait{ to see the secret weapon!}.

00:07:51.880 --> 00:07:53.360
The wait is over!

00:07:57.590 --> 00:07:59.850
It looks good on you, Hatsune-chan. {Though it'd look better on the floor of my van.}

