Marie-kun, I see you're wearing a school swimsuit.

00:08:04.040 --> 00:08:08.250
The color and material are optimal for combat, so...

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:11.740
Your little sister really knows her stuff.

00:08:12.480 --> 00:08:15.220
Don't forget about us~

00:08:16.610 --> 00:08:19.420
We made sure to go for the sexy types.

00:08:19.430 --> 00:08:22.230
How are they? Bet you can't tear your eyes away.

00:08:22.230 --> 00:08:24.670
It's amazing, my honey!

00:08:25.650 --> 00:08:28.110
No~ You're amazingly hopeless, Kou-kun. {Ryo: No~ You shouldn't have, Kouge-chan -- Ryoumi couldn't decide on what this guy's name was, as it's been rendered differently (and incorrectly) in several previous episodes.}

00:08:33.500 --> 00:08:35.200
Still, when it comes to swimsuits, nothing beats a good bikini...

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:39.160
Still, when it comes to swimsuits, nothing beats a good bikini...

00:08:39.550 --> 00:08:41.660
You have the oddest ways of showing your love...

00:08:41.660 --> 00:08:43.620
This is normal for us.

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:46.190
Gorou-chan, help us out here. {You're the only hope for our world!}

00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:53.950
Wow, the ocean sure looks beautiful.

00:09:01.110 --> 00:09:02.680
Is something wrong?

00:09:02.680 --> 00:09:04.810
Eh, no...

00:09:04.810 --> 00:09:07.910
...nothing that matters, anyway.

00:09:07.910 --> 00:09:09.250
Where's Kazuki?

00:09:09.250 --> 00:09:12.940
Don't worry, she'll let you see her in the swimsuit...

00:09:12.940 --> 00:09:16.450
...that you picked out for her, Yuuji-kun.

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:18.370
How did you know?

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:21.330
Big sisters know everything.

00:09:23.790 --> 00:09:27.350
Oh well, I suppose I'll have to praise her a bit.

00:09:31.310 --> 00:09:32.960
S-Sorry I took so long.

00:09:32.960 --> 00:09:35.260
My, you certainly are slow.

00:09:35.260 --> 00:09:36.930
Oh my...

00:09:42.950 --> 00:09:44.390
It looks great on you.

00:09:44.390 --> 00:09:47.310
Yeah, that tankini is really cute.

00:09:47.310 --> 00:09:50.070
Too bad it's not a <i>bi</i>-kini. {rw}

00:09:50.070 --> 00:09:52.320
Onee-chan, you look cool!

00:09:52.320 --> 00:09:55.280
It's good, I think...

00:09:55.280 --> 00:09:57.240
Was this really the one?

00:09:58.250 --> 00:10:01.270
It's really different from your old look.

00:10:01.270 --> 00:10:03.700
I'm kinda embarrassed.

00:10:03.700 --> 00:10:06.200
Don't be; you really are cute.

00:10:06.200 --> 00:10:08.070
You're such a kidder, Kogorou-sensei...

00:10:08.070 --> 00:10:11.080
Yeah, yeah, it sure does fit on you...

00:10:11.080 --> 00:10:14.790
...because it's a childish swimsuit for a childish girl.

00:10:14.790 --> 00:10:19.300
Don't worry, your figure was never in line with my tastes anyway.

00:10:19.300 --> 00:10:23.600
In the end, you and bikinis
 just don't go together.

00:10:25.060 --> 00:10:29.690
If you think any non-bikini swimsuit is childish, then your tastes are worthless! {stc}

00:10:29.690 --> 00:10:32.520
Well, <i>excuse</i>  me{, Princess} for being worthless...

00:10:32.520 --> 00:10:35.270
And I suppose that bikini,

00:10:35.270 --> 00:10:38.530
which <i>somebody</i>  bought especially for you, is equally worthless?

00:10:38.530 --> 00:10:43.490
Yeah, I'm thinking that "somebody" had to have bought it out of pity. {Ryoumi: You're right! The one who bought it certainly didn't buy it just because it's cute. // I'm thinking this is a kawaiisou / kawaisou mishear, although it is a tough call.}

00:10:43.490 --> 00:10:45.870
Well, bikinis aren't bad,

00:10:45.870 --> 00:10:49.460
but a tankini can be better for a sporty girl like Kazuki-chan.

00:10:49.460 --> 00:10:51.000
Sensei...

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:54.370
You've got the rest of your life to wear that "mature" stuff.

00:10:54.370 --> 00:10:58.350
Don't let your youth be wasted 
while you're young.

00:10:58.920 --> 00:11:02.010
Your "helpful advice" isn't helping.{Ryo: "Are you talking about yourself?" // mishear of Gorou / forou [assist, back up]}

00:11:02.010 --> 00:11:04.140
Huh? You don't think so?

00:11:05.070 --> 00:11:07.770
Gorou-sensei, there you go again...

00:11:13.030 --> 00:11:17.120
{Ryoumi missed the 1st half of this line}I guess I screwed that one up.
Sorry about that, Kazuki-chan.

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:30.330
To the ocean!

00:11:30.330 --> 00:11:31.990
Yahoo~

00:11:39.210 --> 00:11:42.880
Aren't you glad that Sensei
 complimented your swimsuit?

00:11:42.880 --> 00:11:44.030
Huh?

00:11:44.570 --> 00:11:48.710
Yuuji, you've been acting strange lately.

00:11:49.100 --> 00:11:53.380
Kogorou-sensei managed 
to smooth things over before, but...

00:11:53.380 --> 00:11:54.980
Hey! 
 Wha...

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:56.920
Let's play together!

00:11:56.920 --> 00:11:58.440
<i>Come on~!</i>

00:11:58.440 --> 00:12:00.440
O-Okay!

00:12:01.880 --> 00:12:04.700
So, you'll just go along with whatever Kogorou-sensei says?

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:06.830
Enjoy this while it lasts...

00:12:13.750 --> 00:12:15.650
Onee-chan, GO GO!

00:12:18.810 --> 00:12:20.460
<i>So refreshing!</i>

00:12:20.460 --> 00:12:23.380
Kazuki-chan, you're still a fast swimmer.

00:12:23.380 --> 00:12:25.510
Ah, Kogorou-sensei.

00:12:25.510 --> 00:12:28.870
I lost to her in our last race.

00:12:28.870 --> 00:12:33.810
Wow, I envy you, Kazuki-chan.
 I can't swim.

00:12:36.610 --> 00:12:38.840
I'm swimming just fine! {tr/off}

00:12:38.840 --> 00:12:41.630
Check me out, I can even do this! {Tr}

00:12:41.630 --> 00:12:44.070
And this! {sttr}

00:12:44.070 --> 00:12:46.030
Why don't we practice for a bit?

00:12:46.030 --> 00:12:49.240
I'm sure you'll be able to swim soon.

00:12:49.240 --> 00:12:53.080
That makes you the teacher now, 
"Arisaka-sensei."

00:12:49.520 --> 00:12:56.250
Don't just sit there. 
Let's play some beach volleyball!

00:12:53.550 --> 00:12:56.250
Very well, Yuuki-kun.

00:13:00.880 --> 00:13:02.710
A little to the right!

00:13:02.710 --> 00:13:03.800
Straight ahead!

00:13:03.800 --> 00:13:05.240
That's the spot!

00:13:06.740 --> 00:13:08.230
You did it!

00:13:08.230 --> 00:13:09.390
Well done.

00:13:10.240 --> 00:13:12.600
Too bad I couldn't break it.

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:14.230
Way to go, Gorou-chin.

00:13:14.230 --> 00:13:17.160
I didn't even graze the darn thing.

00:13:17.160 --> 00:13:18.650
I knew you could do it. {Ryo:"As expected of you." // not wrong, but this is almost as overused as "It can't be helped.}

00:13:18.650 --> 00:13:19.820
It was nothing.

00:13:19.820 --> 00:13:21.820
An opening for a frontal assault! {str}

00:13:22.780 --> 00:13:24.640
How's that?

00:13:25.380 --> 00:13:28.610
So tell me, what're we going to do
 with this watermelon?

00:13:31.580 --> 00:13:34.790
Did you forget we'd be eating it later?

00:13:34.790 --> 00:13:37.850
Unlike Kogorou-sensei,
 you don't think of the consequences.

00:13:37.850 --> 00:13:38.540
I don't?

00:13:38.540 --> 00:13:42.100
I'll treat everyone to shaved ice,
 as a replacement for the watermelon.

00:13:42.100 --> 00:13:43.760
Whoa, you serious?

00:13:43.760 --> 00:13:44.840
Great!

00:13:44.840 --> 00:13:46.200
Lucky! {str}

00:13:50.830 --> 00:13:54.680
<i>You</i>  get to clean up this place, as punishment.

00:13:56.830 --> 00:13:58.520
What the hell was that?!

00:13:58.520 --> 00:14:00.050
Here!

00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:02.440
There you go!

00:14:04.130 --> 00:14:04.860
Marie-chin.

00:14:06.320 --> 00:14:09.370
Damn, why am I being left out?

00:14:09.370 --> 00:14:11.260
Get out of the way!

00:14:11.260 --> 00:14:12.080
Huh?

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:21.710
